meta {
  name: issuer
}

auth {
  mode: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{issuerApiKey}}
}

docs {
  Management API of the data space's portitor-issuer (docs/api/issuer-management-openapi.json),
  started by scripts/dev-identities.sh. Put target/vscode-dcp/issuer/management.key in the
  environment's secret issuerApiKey.
  "DID document", "Issuer metadata", "Status list" and "Health (public port)" call the
  issuer's public port (issuerUrl and issuerServiceUrl, docs/api/issuer-openapi.json) and
  need no key. The credential request and its status take a holder's token: an identity
  sends them ("identity/Request credentials from the issuer").
}
